'''Abyssal Wasting''' is a [[debuff]] which causes affected enemies' [[damage]] with [[hit]]s to be [[unlucky]]. This effect does not stack with other sources of unlucky.

It is inflicted exclusively by [[Summon Bone Feeders]] from the [[Abyssal Bloodline]]'s {{psl|Bone Feeders}} as a debuffing [[aura]].

